OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry to start with bright spells
OL,6,Fin the morning. Turning cloudier
OL,7,Fthrough the day with some showery
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain in North Yorkshire,
OL,9,Fbut staying hot in the south with some
OL,10,Fhazy sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers possible this
OL,13,Fevening, with skies gradually
OL,14,Fclearing. Dry by the end of the night
OL,15,Fwith a few mist patches.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FDry with plenty of sunshine on
OL,18,FMonday. Feeling cooler than today, but
OL,19,Fstill warm in the strong sunshine, and
OL,20,Fa gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
